  "description": "Bring a touch of paradise to your daily planning with this tropical beach-themed notepad. Featuring palm trees, ocean elements, and sunny summer vibes, this memo pad is perfect for to-do lists, notes, planners, journaling, and travel planning. Ideal for beach lovers, students, teachers, and anyone who enjoys bright, tropical stationery.\nYou will receive:\n– single notepad 5″ x 8″, 300dpi\n– 2 notepads per Letter-sized sheet, 300 dpi, transparent background\nPlease NOTE:\n– The colors of the image may vary depending on your computer or mobile monitor.\n– You should also consider that there may be a difference between how the colors look on your screen compared to the actual print\n– You’ll get a ZIP file you’ll need to extract. An unzip app is required to extract the files successfully.",
